<title>JAPAN: Japan July palladium imports down 14.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan July palladium imports down 14.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's palladium imports in July were down 14.5 percent from a year earlier, according to Finance Ministry data released on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The figures were as follows (in kg):</p>
<p>		     July 96   June 96    July 95</p>
<p> Total	     6,660	 7,534	7,791</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	    4,521	 5,343	5,029</p>
<p> South Africa	853	 1,036	1,083</p>
<p>Imports in the first seven months of 1996 were 48.16 tonnes, against 59.90 tonnes in the same period a year earlier.</p>
</text>
